{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-23806", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-23806", "text": "'What you usually notice'", "sha256": "705d667a29e0d18e79a0b5f08339b11442b332d08806d0398a1d59112f2a9f60", "kind": "dart", "start": 23806, "end": 23831, "line": 635}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-25286", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-25286", "text": "'Four numbers, one per week of the cycle, counted back to your own '\n'logged starts. You logged something on ${s.daysByWeek.join('", "sha256": "51ab64dd347c69653a316578f4450845e95a8210f6fcaca2c8fc62164f88f656", "kind": "dart", "start": 25286, "end": 25436, "line": 680}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-25438", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-25438", "text": "')} '\n'days of each week across ${s.cycles} cycles — those are the only '\n'days in any of this.'", "sha256": "deaa0602b9f71c1a8bb904707b144fc6d50e895c73ce00f4dc57f96b9d70ee74", "kind": "dart", "start": 25438, "end": 25574, "line": 681}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30081", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30081", "text": "'I have natural cycles'", "sha256": "08e13549d621c4e7d91aeec2a5888769ed184d2bd3a79363063c07b305b0c725", "kind": "dart", "start": 30081, "end": 30104, "line": 805}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30166", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30166", "text": "'Hormonal contraception'", "sha256": "87eacc1fcd3efec48df25b406784814f242af6a3a2998201cdd6b7bc9cf3a426", "kind": "dart", "start": 30166, "end": 30190, "line": 807}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30234", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30234", "text": "'Pregnant, postpartum, or not cycling'", "sha256": "b744efaa5b4ffbd60effa8e24c0d493c15f024f864e55d8d984317f5578463fe", "kind": "dart", "start": 30234, "end": 30272, "line": 809}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30308", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30308", "text": "'Prefer not to say'", "sha256": "6dbf1373cba2c7c455854ad1b64c2d51aaeef6ef226f5af3f1dcf7b6c3bd2f3d", "kind": "dart", "start": 30308, "end": 30327, "line": 810}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30359", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30359", "text": "'Not set'", "sha256": "0dcc1a27051bce0e9a4e718964acbff196e4c94e975d986c0cb1ab76301a2adf", "kind": "dart", "start": 30359, "end": 30368, "line": 811}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30570", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30570", "text": "'Counts a phase from your logged starts.'", "sha256": "25cdb9351f338b7ae4eeeacb417199d153a74e686de8fd6b4687133f3d4df0f4", "kind": "dart", "start": 30570, "end": 30611, "line": 817}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30679", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30679", "text": "'No ovulation to count from, so no phase. Bleeds are still logged.'", "sha256": "05789c9435109146162cb44abc1778b0f7cc30e9357cc260e19ae73c95129f90", "kind": "dart", "start": 30679, "end": 30746, "line": 820}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30796", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30796", "text": "'No phase and no predicted next. Your biometrics still show.'", "sha256": "7d7712e65db84905350e3ef6a0e297522af9cdb8d4143b2a1faa8e581a570c02", "kind": "dart", "start": 30796, "end": 30857, "line": 823}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-30895", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-30895", "text": "'The app keeps the phase off.'", "sha256": "0ab018e099beb1d1f101a1cb8ab811b2292bef89b9a3a81d79660e5b3219734d", "kind": "dart", "start": 30895, "end": 30925, "line": 824}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart:offset-31403", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/cycle_screen.dart", "location": "offset-31403", "text": "'low mood'", "sha256": "aca7052bdf496608e09caaca7b9e1c13e8238f97f0f2b1a5fc5ffc2e7346b817", "kind": "dart", "start": 31403, "end": 31413, "line": 835}
