{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/day_steps.dart:offset-15709", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/day_steps.dart", "location": "offset-15709", "text": "'Counted at your wrist and by your phone, and the two miscount '\n'differently: a wrist reads a real walk low and can read rhythmic '\n'hand work as walking, while a phone counts only the steps you had '\n'it on you for.'", "sha256": "ef0e189b4458b2ee3d6ecc977a938e6b0a28b41bc6ec2f2bad925a883dba9c20", "kind": "dart", "start": 15709, "end": 15981, "line": 424}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/day_steps.dart:offset-16057", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/day_steps.dart", "location": "offset-16057", "text": "'Counted at your wrist, where a real walk tends to read low and '\n'rhythmic hand work can read as walking.'", "sha256": "96460df20730f2d2be5b09c5296ac9cf338b386ccddf898e71a68fdc2e8492cf", "kind": "dart", "start": 16057, "end": 16182, "line": 430}
