{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/day_timeline.dart:offset-30689", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/day_timeline.dart", "location": "offset-30689", "text": "'Per-device detail is kept for recent days only. Before '\n'${_deviceOldest ?? '\n'} we know which device recorded, '\n'not what it said.'", "sha256": "ce26def217968df3843352e970ce1ec1d46a5a42d76a3b7519a2b1df394a1266", "kind": "dart", "start": 30689, "end": 30871, "line": 830}
