{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/day_timeline.dart:offset-36754", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/day_timeline.dart", "location": "offset-36754", "text": "'These were recorded against the day and carry no time of day, so '\n'they are not placed on it.'", "sha256": "6f4137ffac676ad09847120ff96b85b18d184bc48c079e870613c638a2f8125f", "kind": "dart", "start": 36754, "end": 36870, "line": 991}
